 "keyPoints": [
  "**Both**: oxidation or Cu/Ag **dehydrogenation** of alcohols (1° → aldehyde, 2° → ketone), **ozonolysis** of alkenes, **hydration** of alkynes (ethyne → ethanal).",
  "**Rosenmund**: RCOCl + H₂, Pd–BaSO₄ → RCHO. **Stephen**: RCN + SnCl₂/HCl → imine → RCHO.",
  "**Etard**: toluene + CrO₂Cl₂ → benzaldehyde. **Gatterman-Koch**: benzene + CO + HCl, anhyd. AlCl₃ → benzaldehyde.",
  "**Ketones**: RCN + R′MgX then H₃O⁺; RCOCl + R′₂Cd; **Friedel-Crafts acylation** of benzene (RCOCl, anhyd. AlCl₃)."
